            <ArticleTitle>Data comparing the plasma levels of procollagen C-proteinase enhancer 1 (PCPE-1) in healthy individuals and liver fibrosis patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>777-781</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.dib.2017.08.047</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article provides a protocol for determination of human procollagen C-proteinase enhancer 1 (PCPE-1) concentrations by ELISA. The inter-assay and intra-assay coefficients of variability are given and so are the average plasma concentrations of PCPE-1 in healthy (control) individuals and liver fibrosis patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
